{"name": "Shadows Must Fall", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shadows Must Fall is a top-down arena shooter roguelite where you play collect weapons &amp; build towers to fight off hordes of shadow monsters. Choose from a variety of upgrades and items to create unique builds and survive until the light cleanses the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063370/extras/241678c580604db630e76a27e41607bf.poster.avif?t=1776918820\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063370/extras/241678c580604db630e76a27e41607bf.webm?t=1776918820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063370/extras/241678c580604db630e76a27e41607bf.mp4?t=1776918820\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Build a Living Fortress</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Turn weapons into towers mid-run and reshape the battlefield as the horde closes in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Raise walls, carve choke points, and engineer deadly paths that force enemies exactly where you want them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063370/extras/ddbe117f423f33036d7aeb2788c332a4.poster.avif?t=1776918820\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063370/extras/ddbe117f423f33036d7aeb2788c332a4.webm?t=1776918820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063370/extras/ddbe117f423f33036d7aeb2788c332a4.mp4?t=1776918820\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Craft Game-Breaking Builds</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Socket jewels to transform how your weapons behave, then stack powerful relics to push your strategy to its limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Chase synergies, experiment with wild combinations, and forge a unique build every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063370/extras/293b9648614d777a87c99b2489445070.poster.avif?t=1776918820\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063370/extras/293b9648614d777a87c99b2489445070.webm?t=1776918820\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063370/extras/293b9648614d777a87c99b2489445070.mp4?t=1776918820\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Reshape the Arena</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Decide how the battlefield expands, which monsters emerge, and what terrain you\u2019ll fight across.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each choice alters the flow of the run, forcing you to adapt your build, defenses, and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p> </div>", "short_desc": "A survivors-like roguelite where you build and reshape the arena, transforming weapons into towers as the horde closes in.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063370/cf2e7615b1f4b72df8b8b534f1a387f25e0fcd39/header.jpg?t=1776918820", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Bullet Heaven", "Tower Defense", "Action Roguelike", "Arena Shooter", "Replay Value", "Bullet Hell"], "developers": "Little Big Studio", "publishers": "L